{
  "scene_id": "033_the_march",
  "description": "The war camp stank of determination and desperation in equal measure.",
  "entities": [
    {
      "id": "geralt",
      "name": "Geralt",
      "health": 100.0,
      "max_health": 100.0,
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      },
      "type": "character"
    }
  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 14,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Listen up,\"",
        "line": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 16,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Here's what I'm thinking.\"",
        "line": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 20,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"He's out there. Somewhere. And he's either fighting his way back to us, or he's waiting for us to find him. Either way, we march.\"",
        "line": 33
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 33,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"How many you want?\"",
        "line": 50
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 35,
      "actor": "Mika",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Twenty,\"",
        "line": 53
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 36,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Things always go sideways,\"",
        "line": 55
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 38,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Exactly. So I want people who are good at it.\"",
        "line": 58
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 40,
      "actor": "someone",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What about command here?\"",
        "line": 61
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 48,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Ten days,\"",
        "line": 71
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 50,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Ten days to march to the crash site, search it, and get back. Tight, but doable if we push.\"",
        "line": 74
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 58,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Miss him?\"",
        "line": 86
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 62,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Could be,\"",
        "line": 92
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 66,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Obviously. Someone needs to keep you from doing anything stupid.\"",
        "line": 98
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 68,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Fair assessment.\"",
        "line": 101
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 72,
      "actor": "Sera",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Question,\"",
        "line": 107
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 73,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we expand the search.\"",
        "line": 109
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 75,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And if we run into whoever caused the crash? Because someone knocked that ship out of the sky, and I'm guessing they're not friendly.\"",
        "line": 112
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 76,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then they get to explain themselves.\"",
        "line": 114
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 88,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Listen up,\"",
        "line": 131
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 92,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Avoid contact when possible. When impossible, end it quickly and keep moving. We're not here to fight a war. We're here to find one man and bring him home.\"",
        "line": 137
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 93,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"What if he's\u2014\"",
        "line": 139
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 95,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"He's alive,\"",
        "line": 142
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 98,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Good. We march in five. Check your gear, check your buddy, and prepare for a week of pain.\"",
        "line": 147
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 110,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We'll hit the contested zone around midday tomorrow,\"",
        "line": 166
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 112,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"How recent is this intelligence?\"",
        "line": 169
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 113,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Two weeks old. Could be completely different now.\"",
        "line": 171
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 118,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"More likely to run into bandits, though.\"",
        "line": 178
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 119,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I'll take bandits over trained soldiers any day. Bandits run when the fighting gets hard.\"",
        "line": 180
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 122,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then they'll learn.\"",
        "line": 185
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 124,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Tomorrow's always interesting with you, Commander.\"",
        "line": 188
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 130,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Hang on,\"",
        "line": 196
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 138,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Movement. Ridge line, eleven o'clock.\"",
        "line": 210
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 143,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Probably. We're not exactly stealthy with twenty bodies.\"",
        "line": 217
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 145,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Show them we're not.\"",
        "line": 220
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 152,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Smart,\"",
        "line": 231
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 154,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Or they're flanking us.\"",
        "line": 234
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 168,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Everywhere!\"",
        "line": 254
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 175,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Nature magic!\"",
        "line": 264
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 194,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They're tough!\"",
        "line": 290
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 198,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is insane!\"",
        "line": 296
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 200,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We're trespassing,\"",
        "line": 299
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 202,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Little busy for etiquette lessons!\"",
        "line": 302
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 205,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Trespassers. Despoilers. You bring war-stink into sacred groves. You will feed the soil.\"",
        "line": 307
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 210,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"All who bear weapons despoil. All who march in formation bring war. The forest will reclaim what humanity stole.\"",
        "line": 314
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 217,
      "actor": "she",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Sera,\"",
        "line": 323
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 218,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Enough for what you're thinking, if you're thinking something suitably dramatic.\"",
        "line": 325
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 219,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Always am.\"",
        "line": 327
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 226,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Everyone through!\"",
        "line": 337
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 234,
      "actor": "Mika",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Everyone accounted for?\"",
        "line": 349
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 235,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"All present,\"",
        "line": 351
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 237,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"He can complain all he wants as long as he can still scout.\"",
        "line": 354
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 239,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We're close,\"",
        "line": 357
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 241,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we rest here for two hours, tend injuries, and push for the crash site before dark.\"",
        "line": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 245,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Rest up,\"",
        "line": 366
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 247,
      "actor": "Kress",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Any theories?\"",
        "line": 369
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 273,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cCommander,\u201d",
        "line": 405
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 281,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cWith respect, Commander,\u201d",
        "line": 415
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 290,
      "actor": "Mika",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThey\u2019ll build something,\u201d",
        "line": 428
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 293,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cCommander,\u201d",
        "line": 433
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 297,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cNot alive,\u201d",
        "line": 439
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 298,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cGo,\u201d",
        "line": 441
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 314,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Search this entire ruin,\"",
        "line": 461
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "thought",
      "timestamp": 415,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "think",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"he\"",
        "line": 571
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 423,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Oreck?\"",
        "line": 582
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 434,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The trail,\"",
        "line": 596
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "thought",
      "timestamp": 464,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "think",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Born leader?\"",
        "line": 633
      }
    }
  ],
